#: mixer_backend_i18n.cpp:25
msgid ""
"Controls the volume of the front speakers or all speakers (depending on your "
"soundcard model). If you use a digital output, you might need to also use "
"other controls like ADC or DAC. For headphones, soundcards often supply a "
"Headphone control."
msgstr ""

#: mixer_backend_i18n.cpp:26
msgid ""
"Most media, such as MP3s or Videos, are played back using the PCM channel. "
"As such, the playback volume of such media is controlled by both this and "
"the Master or Headphone channels."
msgstr ""

#: mixer_backend_i18n.cpp:27
msgid ""
"Controls the headphone volume. Some soundcards include a switch that must be "
"manually activated to enable the headphone output."
msgstr ""

#: mixer_backend_i18n.cpp:28
msgid "---"
msgstr "---"

#: mixer_oss4.cpp:491 mixer_oss.cpp:230
msgid ""
"kmix: You do not have permission to access the mixer device.\n"
"Login as root and do a 'chmod a+rw /dev/mixer*' to allow the access."
msgstr ""
"KMix: nun tienes permisos p'acceder al preséu entemecedor.\n"
"Entra como superusuariu y fai un «chmod a+rw /dev/mixer*» pa permitir "
"l'accesu."

#: mixer_oss4.cpp:495
msgid ""
"kmix: Mixer cannot be found.\n"
"Please check that the soundcard is installed and the\n"
"soundcard driver is loaded.\n"
"On Linux you might need to use 'insmod' to load the driver.\n"
"Use 'soundon' when using OSS4 from 4front."
msgstr ""
"KMix: nun pudo alcontrase l'entemecedor.\n"
"Compruebe que la tarxeta de soníu ta instalada y el \n"
"controlador de soníu ta cargáu.\n"
"En Linux, puede necesitar usar «insmod» pa cargar el controlador.\n"
"Use «soundon» si ta usando la versión comercial de OSS."

